  en:['Air freight built around your priorities.','When you work to precise timelines and demanding project schedules, our experienced air freight team helps move your cargo efficiently to its final destination. Whatever the shipment’s size, shape or nature, we provide flexible solutions designed around your requirements.','Import, export and cross-trade shipments|Direct coordination with IATA and FIATA accredited agents|Complete document preparation|Door-to-door and airport-to-airport service|General, fragile, perishable and oversized cargo|Air charter solutions|Palletising, packing and warehousing support','One clear flight plan.','Cargo review|Route and quote|Documents and handling|Arrival and delivery'],
